<mxfile host="Electron" agent="Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) draw.io/24.7.8 Chrome/128.0.6613.36 Electron/32.0.1 Safari/537.36" version="24.7.8">
  <diagram id="flight-path-controller" name="Flight path controller">
    <mxGraphModel dx="924" dy="559" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1900" pageHeight="940" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;Flight path controller&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;— outer guidance loop cascaded into the inner steering loop" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=18;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="20" width="1400" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;src/figure_eight_controller.jl (guidance, block B) feeds src/course_controller.jl (blocks C/D/F/G) — steps 2 and 3 of docs/control_algorithm.md, run once per timestep (1/sample_freq): geometry in, rel_steering/rel_depower out.&lt;br&gt;The winch/reel-out speed loop (bottom right) closes on tether force and is independent of everything shown here — see reelout_state_machine.drawio.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="54" width="1700" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="A" value="&lt;b&gt;Reference path&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Lemniscate in (azimuth, elevation),&amp;nbsp;fixed before flight&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="245" width="140" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="B" value="&lt;b&gt;Guidance — outer loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;calc_attractor / navigate_fig8&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;closest point Q &lt;br&gt;→&amp;nbsp;walk attractor_distance ahead &lt;br&gt;→ attractor R&lt;br&gt;great-circle course to R → chi_set&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="280" y="220" width="250" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="C" value="&lt;b&gt;Entry state machine +&lt;br&gt;descent limiter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;0 park → 1 dive → 2 hold → 3 transition → 4 fig8&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;During phase 1/2 override chi_set with chi_dive/chi_hold. The descent limiter blends toward entry_chi_max.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="610" y="205" width="260" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sigma" value="&lt;b&gt;Σ&lt;/b&gt;" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=20;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="930" y="265" width="40" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sigma_plus" value="+" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="900" y="248" width="20" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sigma_minus" value="&amp;minus;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="955" y="310" width="20" height="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lbl_err" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;err&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="978" y="270" width="44" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="D" value="&lt;b&gt;Gain-scheduled PID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;A PD controller (no integral term) on the heading/course error&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Its gain rises as apparent wind drops, and is cut to 25% during the entry phases (0–2)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Output is clamped to ±max_steering&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Held at zero while parked (phase 0), but still updated every step so phase 1 starts smoothly&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1040" y="190" width="300" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="E" value="&lt;b&gt;Plant — V3Kite / step!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;external: src/ has no kite-model&lt;br&gt;dependency (see CLAUDE.md)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;in: rel_steering, rel_depower&lt;br&gt;out: SysState — heading, course,&lt;br&gt;elevation, azimuth, v_kite, v_app&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;dashed=1;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1500" y="190" width="260" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="F" value="&lt;b&gt;Depower ladder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;entry_depower (dive/hold) →&lt;br&gt;depower_setpoint (pattern) →&lt;br&gt;depower_final (phase 5)&lt;br&gt;ramped over depower_blend_time&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="610" y="470" width="220" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="G" value="&lt;b&gt;Feedback angle blend ψ&#39;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;ψ&#39; = heading + w_course·wrap2pi(course_shifted&lt;br&gt;− heading); course_shifted = wrap2pi(course +&lt;br&gt;course_offset)&lt;br&gt;w_course blends by v_kite (v_kite_heading →&lt;br&gt;v_kite_course); fig8_pure_course ⇒ w_course = 1&lt;br&gt;from phase ≥ 3&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="900" y="470" width="340" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="W" value="&lt;b&gt;Winch / reel-out loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;independent — closes on tether&lt;br&gt;force, not on the steering loop&lt;br&gt;above; see reelout_state_machine.drawio&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1500" y="470" width="260" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_ab" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;path (az, el)&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="A" target="B" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_bc" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;chi_set&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="B" target="C" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_cs" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;chi_cmd&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="C" target="sigma" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_sd" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="sigma" target="D" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_de" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;rel_steering&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="D" target="E" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_ed_vapp" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;v_app [m/s]&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.2;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontColor=#6c8ebf;exitX=0.8;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.2;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="E" target="D" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="1708" y="120" />
              <mxPoint x="1100" y="120" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_cd_phase" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;phase&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.2;dashed=1;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#d79b00;exitX=0.8;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.7;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="C" target="D" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="818" y="140" />
              <mxPoint x="1250" y="140" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_ec_el" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;elevation [rad]&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.2;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#666666;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.7;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="E" target="C" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="1630" y="160" />
              <mxPoint x="792" y="160" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_eb_azel" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;azimuth, elevation (SysState, previous step)&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.2;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#666666;exitX=0.2;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.7;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="E" target="B" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="1552" y="180" />
              <mxPoint x="455" y="180" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_cf_phase" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;phase&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.2;dashed=1;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#d79b00;exitX=0.3;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.35;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="C" target="F" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_gs_psi" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;ψ&#39;&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.15;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="G" target="sigma" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_eg_hcv" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;heading, course, v_kite (SysState)&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.2;strokeColor=#666666;fontColor=#666666;exitX=0.05;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.9;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=center;verticalAlign=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="E" target="G" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="1513" y="420" />
              <mxPoint x="1206" y="420" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_fe_depower" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;rel_depower&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.7;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.13;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="F" target="E" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="764" y="680" />
              <mxPoint x="1350" y="680" />
              <mxPoint x="1350" y="380" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e_ew_force" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;tether force / winch mode&lt;/font&gt;" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.2;dashed=1;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#999999;exitX=0.7;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;" parent="1" source="E" target="W" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend1" value="&lt;b&gt;Signal conventions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bearing:&lt;/b&gt; 0 = towards zenith, positive toward larger azimuth — chi_set is directly comparable to SysState.heading, same zero and sign.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;course_offset&lt;/b&gt; (π by default) must be added to SysState.course before use; feeding it unshifted is positive feedback and diverges the run.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;rel_steering&lt;/b&gt; is fed UNNEGATED on this plant (measured, r = +0.998) — other kites in the ecosystem negate; that does not transfer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;err&lt;/b&gt; = wrap2pi(ψ&#39; − chi_cmd), wrapped here because DiscretePIDs does not wrap.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="700" width="860" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend2" value="&lt;b&gt;Cascade, gain scheduling &amp;amp; engagement&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Guidance (B) and steering (C/Σ/D) run once per timestep (1/sample_freq) and together form the flight controller proper: geometry in, rel_steering out. The reference path (A) is built once before flight, or at most walked slowly during it.&lt;br&gt;The PID gain is scheduled twice: by &lt;b&gt;apparent wind&lt;/b&gt; (K ∝ v_app_ref/v_app, cancelling the plant&#39;s ψ̇ ≈ c1·v_a·u_s) and by &lt;b&gt;phase&lt;/b&gt; (entry_gain = 25 % below phase 3, full gain from phase 3).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Engagement is bumpless:&lt;/b&gt; the PID is stepped with a zero error and its output discarded during park (phase 0), so phase 1&#39;s first command is not a step.&lt;br&gt;See docs/control_algorithm.md §2–3 for the full derivation and docs/reelout_state_machine.drawio for the phase ladder and winch detail.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="960" y="700" width="860" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
